    "body": "Preserve provider selection/install, identity/Wiki initialization, HTTP startup and native Fastify failure handling. Reconcile current-main architecture and dependency pins, then establish combined backend and browser evidence.\n\nTracks #352; decomposition epic #323; extracted from #305.\n\n**Layer 14/23:** 10 changed files, +462/\u2212232. Review against previous layer #351; the diff contains only this task's paths.\n\nThis is a review/extraction of final file versions from PR #305, not a claim that its historical checkpoints or new intermediate heads are production-ready. All replacement PRs are draft. Their branches are cumulative and based on the source PR's historical merge-base; only layer 1 targets main. Some whole-file layers have forward dependencies, recorded below. Do not merge intermediate layers until their prerequisites and current-main reconciliation are validated.\n\nMerge blockers: #324 (main reconciliation), #325 (qualification).\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Selected providers are validated and available before dependent behavior is accepted as ready.\n- Identity refusal or incomplete Wiki composition prevents successful startup with a visible failure.\n- Switching providers cannot reuse stale prior selection, and failed selected persistence does not silently fall back.\n- Integrated guarded tests, production compile and strict lint pass using published pins; browser proof identifies the served checkout.\n- Inherited review findings for this scope are fixed with fresh evidence or explicitly adjudicated; the split itself resolves none.\n\n## Original source validation\n\nFresh checks on the **cumulative source** `1d3b207a`: 35 targeted JavaScript checks passed; backend typecheck/server compile passed with zero compiler warnings; the full guarded CLJS test target passed 1,857 tests / 8,423 assertions, zero failures/errors. These results do not validate each intermediate PR, current-main integration, or a live server (the isolated OpenPlanner SDK link is absent). Frontend typecheck, production build and migration inventory passed; Vitest passed 274 tests with 41 TODO, and frontend CLJS passed 526 tests / 2,282 assertions with zero failures/errors/compiler warnings. Frontend lint passed with zero warnings/errors. **Strict backend lint fails: 188 warnings, zero errors, exit 2**; this remains a merge blocker. Live browser acceptance remains incomplete.\n\nCommands for this scope, after prerequisites:\n\n- `pnpm -C backend run test`\n- `pnpm -C backend run typecheck`\n- `pnpm -C backend run lint`\n- `pnpm -C backend run build`\n- `pnpm -C backend run boundary:check`\n\n## Dependencies\n\nStatic namespace inventory found no unavailable local namespaces at this cumulative layer. Compiler/test execution is still required.\n\n## Review focus\n\n- Readiness precedes asynchronous Mongo installation in handle-app-listening!; delayed/failing provider behavior needs review.\n- Current-main semantic conflicts and unresolved review findings block merge readiness despite exact tree preservation.\n- Historical evidence includes local dependency overrides and incomplete browser acceptance.\n\n## Inherited bot findings\n\n- [Register the Axxium HTTP authentication surface](https://github.com/open-hax/knoxx/pull/305#discussion_r3995855879) \u2014 revalidate; an unresolved historical thread does not establish a current defect.\n\nPreserved source commit: `1d3b207ab2e5bfc6b2fa149836b855d458a9c997`. The original extraction preserved its assigned source blobs. Verified review follow-ups and any ownership adjustments are recorded in the linked task.\n\n<!-- pr305-current-validation -->\n\n## Current review head\n\nHead `5bf0831bb394be42f1303936fb8627e9bd3e5ce7`. Earlier review fixes have been propagated through ordinary forward merges; no published history was rewritten. Review this scoped diff against its configured predecessor.\n\nValidation on the assembled head `9672796cbd39c2264d490fd580fa5cd3a13f258b`: **1,879 backend tests / 8,639 assertions** and **529 frontend CLJS tests / 2,297 assertions**, zero failures/errors/compiler warnings. Backend server compile and frontend typecheck, complete production build, migration inventory and strict frontend lint pass. The 43 targeted JavaScript checks pass. Vitest's 274 passing tests / 41 TODO were run on the identical frontend tree (`343d94dd4760a814d5583ad4d600b80ace83ab28`); TODOs remain unexecuted.\n\n**Strict backend lint remains blocked: 188 warnings, zero errors, exit 2.** This validates the assembled tree, not every intermediate head or a live deployment. The OpenPlanner runtime SDK link, current-main reconciliation (#324), live browser acceptance and remaining review findings (#325 and linked tasks) remain open. All PRs stay draft with auto-merge disabled.\n",
